{"speciesId":575,"names":{"fr":"Mesmérella","es":"Gothorita","en":"Gothorita","ja":"ゴチミル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Hypnotise les Pokémon et les gens. Il y a de nombreuses légendes de gens enlevés dans leur sommeil par des Mesmérella."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Tire son énergie de la lumière des étoiles et marque leur position en faisant léviter des pierres la nuit."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Tire son énergie de la lumière des étoiles et marque leur position en faisant léviter des pierres la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La luz de las estrellas origina su poder. De noche, marca su posición haciendo levitar piedras con su poder psíquico."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"星明りが パワーの 源。 夜になると サイコパワーで 石を 浮かべて 星の 配置を 印す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit qu’ils apparaissent les nuits étoilées et manipulent les enfants pour jouer avec eux."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Según muchas leyendas, durante las noches estrelladas controlan a los niños que duermen, tan solo como diversión."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"星明かりが 輝く 夜に 寝ている 子供たちを 操って 遊ぶ 話が 多く 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tire son énergie de la lumière des étoiles et marque leur position en faisant léviter des pierres la nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La luz de las estrellas origina su poder. De noche, marca su posición haciendo levitar piedras con su poder psíquico."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"星明りが パワーの 源。 夜になると サイコパワーで 石を 浮かべて 星の 配置を 印す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit qu’ils apparaissent les nuits étoilées et manipulent les enfants pour jouer avec eux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Según muchas leyendas, durante las noches estrelladas controlan a los niños que duermen, tan solo como diversión."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"星明かりが 輝く 夜に 寝ている 子供たちを 操って 遊ぶ 話が 多く 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On raconte qu’il enlève les enfants endormis pendant les nuits étoilées. Cela lui vaut d’être considéré comme un démon punisseur."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Corre el rumor de que en las noches estrelladas se lleva consigo a los niños dormidos, por lo que recibe el sobrenombre de Bruja Castigadora."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s said that when stars shine in the night sky, this Pokémon will spirit away sleeping children. Some call it the Witch of Punishment."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"星が 輝く 夜に 眠った 子どもたちを 連れ去ると 言われ 制裁の魔女 とも 呼ばれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses pouvoirs psychiques semblent a